{
  "sentences": [
    {
      "start": 2.45,
      "end": 22.55,
      "text": "Well, hello and welcome to this month's masterclass video lesson. I'm excited because we're doing something a little bit different since I'm on vacation. I was lucky enough to get, I guess I kind of may push my way a little bit. I apologize, but I'm always so excited when I get to interview interesting people doing interesting things."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.55,
      "end": 34.83,
      "text": "So this is Kyle, a new friend of mine. Actually, he happened to stay with my mom for quite a while. So he has an interesting job and I'll let him introduce himself and then we can learn more about what he does."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.31,
      "end": 48.83,
      "text": "My name's Kyle and just moved here to Bend from Boulder, Colorado about eight months ago and just found this job on Craigslist, which it was really easy."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.97,
      "end": 52.53,
      "text": "Came for an interview, met the guy, saw the two shots."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.55,
      "end": 57.03,
      "text": "And I was like, all right, let's give this a try and see how it goes."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.13,
      "end": 59.45,
      "text": "And it's worked out really well."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.27,
      "end": 67.21,
      "text": "So I, you know, from the beginning, the whole allure for me was all the different things that I could learn."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.57,
      "end": 72.25,
      "text": "Because there's just so many trades that go into working on a trailer."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.57,
      "end": 78.23,
      "text": "It's kind of like working on a house. You have plumbing, electrical, insulation, you know."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.37,
      "end": 79.39,
      "text": "Yeah, it's like a mini house."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.61,
      "end": 82.19,
      "text": "Yeah, exactly. So everything that you have to do on a house."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.19,
      "end": 83.01,
      "text": "You do on a trailer."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.19,
      "end": 96.39,
      "text": "And I've since, you know, beginning gotten more specialized in just doing cabinetry, building them, installing them, everything, especially with the Airstreams."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.39,
      "end": 100.35,
      "text": "They're circular. And so it's really difficult."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.57,
      "end": 102.35,
      "text": "You got to do a lot of scribing."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.49,
      "end": 104.19,
      "text": "What's that? What's scribing?"
    },
    {
      "start": 104.21,
      "end": 112.09,
      "text": "Scribing is like where you start with a rough piece of material and then you start getting it kind of closer to the."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.19,
      "end": 112.87,
      "text": "Actual curvature."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.07,
      "end": 113.83,
      "text": "Oh, OK."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.95,
      "end": 114.15,
      "text": "Huh."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.97,
      "end": 115.75,
      "text": "Because you can't."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.75,
      "end": 118.59,
      "text": "Because there's so many curved edges on an Airstream trailer."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.75,
      "end": 119.37,
      "text": "Yeah, exactly."
    },
    {
      "start": 119.63,
      "end": 119.67,
      "text": "OK."
    }
  ],
